WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:05.993
VERION is currently a pre-launch business with working prototypes, not an operating platform.

00:00:06.023 --> 00:00:10.583
We plan to raise five hundred million yen in seed equity.

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:14.970
That capital is intended to build the service and test one complete commercial cycle.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:19.360
The planned initial product is a three-thousand-yen cel-preservation support package.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:24.106
It includes five random commemorative pieces made only from rights-cleared material.

00:00:24.136 --> 00:00:29.336
Completing the image gives no points, tournament access, cash value, or prize.

00:00:29.436 --> 00:00:34.162
Users earn free competition points only by answering sponsor advertising quizzes.

00:00:34.192 --> 00:00:38.752
Regular anime quizzes create competition scores, but do not add wallet points.

00:00:38.782 --> 00:00:44.362
The points cannot be sold, transferred, cashed out, or exchanged for crypto assets.

00:00:44.462 --> 00:00:50.034
Initial revenue comes from preservation support and referral fees on attributed purchases.

00:00:50.064 --> 00:00:55.210
Management reports reserve sponsor funds for prizes. Financial reporting follows each contract.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:00.815
Advertising fees, licensed cards, and data services are later options with separate conditions.

00:01:00.915 --> 00:01:03.924
Product development receives two hundred million yen.

00:01:03.954 --> 00:01:09.105
IP licensing receives one hundred fifty million yen; acquisition receives seventy million.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:14.289
Legal work receives fifty million yen; thirty million is held as contingency.

00:01:14.389 --> 00:01:18.389
Each financing round is planned to follow measurable operating gates.

00:01:18.419 --> 00:01:23.565
Seed tests acquisition, verified use, return behavior, support purchases, and sponsor renewal.

00:01:23.595 --> 00:01:28.315
Growth targets and profit dates are internal assumptions, not guaranteed outcomes.

00:01:28.415 --> 00:01:33.935
Official cards require IP licenses, and physical ownership does not create digital-use rights.

00:01:33.965 --> 00:01:39.117
Prize, point, payment, and prediction features require legal review in each country.

00:01:39.147 --> 00:01:43.878
Data services require notice, consent, protection, aggregation, and evidence of usefulness.

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:49.983
Internal records list 1,454 cels and drawings. The unaudited value does not protect principal.

00:01:50.013 --> 00:01:56.447
The ten-billion-yen valuation cap is a planned term. Ownership depends on contracts and later financing.

00:01:56.477 --> 00:02:03.037
One trillion yen is a long-term internal target. Value, exit, principal and returns are not guaranteed.

00:02:03.137 --> 00:02:07.857
Investors are funding a defined build, licensing work, and measurable validation.

00:02:07.887 --> 00:02:12.615
The plan separates current facts, future conditions, internal assumptions, and risks.

00:02:12.645 --> 00:02:17.445
The seed objective is evidence for the next decision, not a promise of scale.
